{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fallen friendship, a stolen love.<br>To rescue the beloved woman taken by his closest friend,<br>a jet-black avenger cuts through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-speed \u00d7 exhilarating run action.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve through enemy lines with the Quick Slash!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overwhelming sense of exhilaration with simple controls just lock onto an enemy and press the attack button.<br>Become a gust of wind and slice through hordes of yokai with lightning-fast sword techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/ff6ca43eb6e2fde57c55a8771c06448d.poster.avif?t=1760094269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/ff6ca43eb6e2fde57c55a8771c06448d.webm?t=1760094269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/ff6ca43eb6e2fde57c55a8771c06448d.mp4?t=1760094269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn more time with the ultimate move Gale Rush!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the moon sets and the sun rises, the forbidden ritual will make everything irreversible.<br>Yet only one minute remains until dawn.<br>Secret art Gale Rush extends the time until sunrise by consuming the souls of enemies with each strike.<br>Being surrounded by many enemies is not only a crisis it is also an opportunity.<br>Keep struggling never give up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272710/extras/aeef6b1cd62011aceb76326e77fb4785.poster.avif?t=1760094269\" width=1170 height=658 >